 Tier 2: Layout Model Fixes

 Impact: Multi-column layouts, sidebars, overlays actually work
 Effort: ~800-1000 lines total

 2A. CSS Float (~300 lines)

 Float elements left/right with text wrapping around them.

 - Maintain float context: list of active left/right floats with (x, y, width, height)
 - Block elements: check float context, reduce available width, offset x
 - Clear: clear: left/right/both advances y past floats
 - Inline text wraps around float boundaries
 - Files: Library.HTMLLayout.ailang (major changes to block and inline layout)

 2B. Position: absolute/fixed (~200 lines)

 Positioned elements for dropdowns, modals, tooltips.

 - Absolute: position relative to nearest positioned ancestor (or viewport)
 - Fixed: position relative to viewport (ignores scroll)
 - Read top/left/right/bottom/width/height from CSS
 - Remove from normal flow (don't affect siblings)
 - Render on top (after normal flow elements — z-order)
 - Files: Library.HTMLLayout.ailang (two-pass: normal flow first, positioned elements second),
 Library.HTMLRender.ailang (z-order command sorting)

 2C. Table Layout (~200 lines)

 Currently <table> renders as stacked blocks. Need column/row grid.

 - First pass: measure column widths (max content width per column)
 - Second pass: lay out cells in grid (x = sum of previous column widths, y = row offset)
 - Handle colspan/rowspan (basic: just span width/height)
 - Border-collapse: separate (default)
 - Files: Library.HTMLLayout.ailang (add LY__TableLayout function)

 2D. Box Model Fixes (~100 lines)

 - box-sizing: border-box — width includes padding+border (default is content-box)
 - Margin collapsing — adjacent block margins collapse to max(top_margin, bottom_margin)
 - Min/max width/height — min-width, max-width, min-height, max-height
 - Files: Library.HTMLLayout.ailang

 2E. Overflow: hidden/scroll (~100 lines)

 - overflow: hidden — clip children to container bounds (skip draw commands outside box)
 - overflow: scroll/auto — show scrollbar indicator, clip content
 - Clipping in renderer: maintain clip stack, reject commands outside current clip rect
 - Files: Library.HTMLRender.ailang (clip stack), Library.HTMLLayout.ailang (overflow property)

